flowchart LR
 Req[GES Requirement IDs] --> Work[Work Item]
 Work --> ADR[Architecture Decision if needed]
 Work --> Code[Code + Migration + Docs]
 Code --> Tests[Unit / Integration / Contract / E2E]
 Tests --> Sec[Security / Tenant / AI / Performance Gates]
 Sec --> Trace[Traceability + Evidence]
 Trace --> Review[Human Review / Acceptance]
 Review --> Package[Versioned Artifact]
 Package --> Promote[Controlled Environment Promotion]
 Promote --> Release[Release Evidence]
